#: about.php:29 include/global_arrays.php:2655 lib/html.php:2901
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "O programu Cacti"

#: about.php:42
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "Cacti je zasnovan kot celovita rešitev za izrisovanje grafov, ki temelji na časovni zbirki podatkov (TSDB) in rešitvi za grafe RRDtool. Njegov namen je olajšati delo omrežnega skrbnika, tako da poskrbi za vse pomembne podrobnosti, potrebne za ustvarjanje smiselnih grafov."

#: about.php:44
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Na uradni %sspletni strani Cacti%s najdete informacije o uporabi programa Cacti, podpori in posodobitvah."

#: about.php:48
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Aktivni razvijalci"

#: about.php:49
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Razvijalci, ki delajo na programu Cacti, njegovi arhitekturi, dokumentaciji in prihodnjih izdajah."

#: about.php:61
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Častne omembe"

#: about.php:62
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Sodelavci pri dokumentaciji, zagotavljanju kakovosti, pakiranju, forumih in našem kanalu YouTube."

#: about.php:70
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Zaslužni člani"

#: about.php:71
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Člani prvotne skupine Cacti, ki so se v karieri odpravili naprej.  Še naprej jim želimo vse najboljše."

#: about.php:84
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Zahvale"

#: about.php:87
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "Posebna zahvala gre %sTobiju Oetikerju%s, ustvarjalcu programa %sRRDtool%s in zelo priljubljenega programa %sMRTG%s."

#: about.php:90
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Uporabniki programa Cacti"

#: about.php:91
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Še posebej vsem, ki so si vzeli čas za izdelavo poročila o težavi ali kako drugače pomagali odpraviti težave, povezane s programom Cacti. Prav tako vsem, ki so prispevali k podpori programa Cacti."

#: about.php:96
msgid "License"
msgstr "Licenca"

#: about.php:98
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "Cacti je licenciran pod licenco GNU GPL:"

#: about.php:102 lib/installer.php:1866
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Ta program je prosta programska oprema; lahko ga redistribuirate in/ali spreminjate pod pogoji licence GNU General Public License, kot jo je objavila Free Software Foundation; bodisi različice 2 licence bodisi (po vaši izbiri) katere koli poznejše različice."

#: about.php:110
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Ta program je distribuiran v upanju, da bo koristen, vendar BREZ KAKRŠNEGA KOLI JAMSTVA; tudi brez implicitnega jamstva TRŽNOSTI ali PRIMERNOSTI ZA DOLOČEN NAMEN. Za več podrobnosti glejte licenco GNU General Public License."

