#: index.php:89
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Cacti Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Cacti's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Cacti Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Cacti Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>OPOMBA:</strong> Prijavljeni ste v oddaljeni zbiralnik podatkov.  Ko je <b>»na spletu«</b>, boste lahko pregledovali in nadzirali velik del glavnega spletnega mesta Cacti, kot bi bili prijavljeni vanj.  Pomembno je tudi, da morajo oddaljeni zbiralniki podatkov uporabljati funkcijo storitev za pospeševanje zmogljivosti programa Cacti <b>»posodabljanje na zahtevo«</b>, in vedno priporočamo uporabo programa Spine.  Ko je oddaljeni zbiralnik podatkov <b>»brez povezave«</b>, bo spletno mesto oddaljenega zbiralnika podatkov vsebovalo precej manj informacij.  Vendar bo vse posodobitve shranjeval v predpomnilnik, dokler glavna zbirka podatkov Cacti in spletni strežnik nista dosegljiva.  Nato bo izhod svoje tabele Boost vrnil v glavno zbirko podatkov Cacti za posodobitev."

#: index.php:94
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Cacti Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>OPOMBA:</strong> Doslej noben od osrednjih vtičnikov programa Cacti ni bil preoblikovan za delo z oddaljenimi zbiralniki podatkov.  Zato vtičniki, kot sta MacTrack in HMIB, ki zahtevajo neposreden dostop do naprav, trenutno z oddaljenimi zbiralniki podatkov ne bodo delovali.  Vtičniki, kot je Thold, pa bodo delovali, če je oddaljeni zbiralnik podatkov v načinu <b>»na spletu«</b>."

