#: lib/installer.php:2170
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "V redkih primerih smo prejeli poročila uporabnikov, ki imajo manjše težave zaradi sprememb v kodi.  Te težave povzroča brskalnik, ki ohrani kodo pred nadgradnjo, in čeprav smo sprejeli ukrepe za zmanjšanje verjetnosti, se lahko še vedno pojavijo.  Če potrebujete navodila, kako počistiti predpomnilnik brskalnika, je <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> dobro izhodišče."

#: lib/installer.php:2171
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Če po čiščenju predpomnilnika in ponovnem zagonu brskalnika še vedno imate težave, nam jih sporočite in poskušali bomo ugotoviti vzrok."

#: lib/installer.php:2177
#, php-format
msgid "Downgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Prehod z <strong>%s</strong> na starejšo <strong>%s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php:2178
msgid "You appear to be downgrading to a previous version.  Database changes made for the newer version will not be reversed and <i>could</i> cause issues."
msgstr "Zdi se, da prehajate na starejšo različico.  Spremembe zbirke podatkov, narejene za novejšo različico, ne bodo razveljavljene in <i>lahko</i> povzročijo težave."

#: lib/installer.php:2183
msgid "Please select the type of installation"
msgstr "Izberite vrsto namestitve"

#: lib/installer.php:2184
msgid "Installation options:"
msgstr "Možnosti namestitve:"

#: lib/installer.php:2188
msgid "Choose this for the Primary site."
msgstr "To izberite za primarno mesto."

#: lib/installer.php:2188 lib/installer.php:2239
msgid "New Primary Server"
msgstr "Nov primarni strežnik"

#: lib/installer.php:2189 lib/installer.php:2240
msgid "New Remote Poller"
msgstr "Nov oddaljeni poller"

#: lib/installer.php:2189
msgid "Remote Pollers are used to access networks that are not readily accessible to the Primary site."
msgstr "Oddaljeni pollerji se uporabljajo za dostop do omrežij, ki niso zlahka dostopna iz primarnega mesta."

#: lib/installer.php:2244
msgid "The following information has been determined from Cacti's configuration file. If it is not correct, please edit \"include/config.php\" before continuing."
msgstr "Naslednje informacije so bile ugotovljene iz konfiguracijske datoteke programa Cacti. Če niso pravilne, pred nadaljevanjem uredite »include/config.php«."

#: lib/installer.php:2248
msgid "Local Database Connection Information"
msgstr "Informacije o povezavi z lokalno zbirko podatkov"

#: lib/installer.php:2251 lib/installer.php:2263
#, php-format
msgid "Database: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Zbirka podatkov: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php:2252 lib/installer.php:2264
#, php-format
msgid "Database User: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Uporabnik zbirke podatkov: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php:2253 lib/installer.php:2265
#, php-format
msgid "Database Hostname: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Gostiteljsko ime zbirke podatkov: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php:2254 lib/installer.php:2266
#, php-format
msgid "Port: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Vrata: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php:2255 lib/installer.php:2267
#, php-format
msgid "Server Operating System Type: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Vrsta operacijskega sistema strežnika: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php:2260
msgid "Central Database Connection Information"
msgstr "Informacije o povezavi z osrednjo zbirko podatkov"

#: lib/installer.php:2272
msgid "Configuration Readonly!"
msgstr "Konfiguracija je samo za branje!"

#: lib/installer.php:2274
msgid "Your config.php file must be writable by the web server during install in order to configure the Remote poller.  Once installation is complete, you must set this file to Read Only to prevent possible security issues."
msgstr "Vaša datoteka config.php mora biti med namestitvijo zapisljiva za spletni strežnik, da lahko konfigurirate oddaljeni poller.  Ko je namestitev končana, morate to datoteko nastaviti na samo za branje, da preprečite morebitne varnostne težave."

#: lib/installer.php:2278
msgid "Configuration of Poller"
msgstr "Konfiguracija pollerja"

#: lib/installer.php:2279
msgid "Your Remote Cacti Poller information has not been included in your config.php file.  Please review the config.php.dist, and set the variables: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, etc.  These variables must be set and point back to your Primary Cacti database server.  Correct this and try again."
msgstr "Informacije o vašem oddaljenem pollerju Cacti niso vključene v datoteko config.php.  Oglejte si config.php.dist in nastavite spremenljivke: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i> itd.  Te spremenljivke morajo biti nastavljene in kazati nazaj na vaš primarni strežnik zbirke podatkov Cacti.  To popravite in poskusite znova."

#: lib/installer.php:2283
msgid "Remote Poller Variables"
msgstr "Spremenljivke oddaljenega pollerja"

#: lib/installer.php:2285
msgid "The variables that must be set in the config.php file include the following:"
msgstr "Spremenljivke, ki morajo biti nastavljene v datoteki config.php, vključujejo naslednje:"

#: lib/installer.php:2296
msgid "The Installer automatically assigns a $poller_id and adds it to the config.php file."
msgstr "Namestitveni program samodejno dodeli $poller_id in ga doda v datoteko config.php."

#: lib/installer.php:2298
msgid "Once the variables are all set in the config.php file, you must also grant the $rdatabase_username access to the main Cacti database server.  Follow the same procedure you would with any other Cacti install.  You may then press the 'Test Connection' button.  If the test is successful you will be able to proceed and complete the install."
msgstr "Ko so vse spremenljivke nastavljene v datoteki config.php, morate uporabniku $rdatabase_username odobriti tudi dostop do glavnega strežnika zbirke podatkov Cacti.  Sledite enakemu postopku kot pri vsaki drugi namestitvi programa Cacti.  Nato lahko pritisnete gumb »Test Connection«.  Če je preizkus uspešen, boste lahko nadaljevali in dokončali namestitev."

#: lib/installer.php:2302
msgid "Additional Steps After Installation"
msgstr "Dodatni koraki po namestitvi"

#: lib/installer.php:2304
msgid "It is essential that the Central Cacti server can communicate via MySQL to each remote Cacti database server.  Once the install is complete, you must edit the Remote Data Collector and ensure the settings are correct.  You can verify using the 'Test Connection' when editing the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Bistveno je, da osrednji strežnik Cacti lahko prek MySQL komunicira z vsakim oddaljenim strežnikom zbirke podatkov Cacti.  Ko je namestitev končana, morate urediti oddaljeni zbiralnik podatkov in poskrbeti, da so nastavitve pravilne.  To lahko preverite z »Test Connection« pri urejanju oddaljenega zbiralnika podatkov."

#: lib/installer.php:2317
msgid "Critical Binary Locations and Versions"
msgstr "Kritične lokacije in različice izvršljivih datotek"

#: lib/installer.php:2318
msgid "Make sure all of these values are correct before continuing."
msgstr "Pred nadaljevanjem se prepričajte, da so vse te vrednosti pravilne."

#: lib/installer.php:2321
msgid "One or more paths appear to be incorrect, unable to proceed"
msgstr "Ena ali več poti je videti napačnih, nadaljevanje ni mogoče"

#: lib/installer.php:2398
msgid "Directory Permission Checks"
msgstr "Preverjanja dovoljenj imenikov"

#: lib/installer.php:2399
msgid "Please ensure the directory permissions below are correct before proceeding.  During the install, these directories need to be owned by the Web Server user.  These permission changes are required to allow the Installer to install Device Template packages which include XML and script files that will be placed in these directories.  If you choose not to install the packages, there is an 'install_package.php' cli script that can be used from the command line after the install is complete."
msgstr "Pred nadaljevanjem se prepričajte, da so dovoljenja imenikov spodaj pravilna.  Med namestitvijo morajo biti ti imeniki v lasti uporabnika spletnega strežnika.  Te spremembe dovoljenj so potrebne, da lahko namestitveni program namesti pakete predlog naprav, ki vsebujejo datoteke XML in skripte, ki bodo postavljene v te imenike.  Če paketov ne želite namestiti, obstaja cli skripta 'install_package.php', ki jo lahko uporabite iz ukazne vrstice po končani namestitvi."

#: lib/installer.php:2402
msgid "After the install is complete, you can make some of these directories read only to increase security."
msgstr "Po končani namestitvi lahko nekatere od teh imenikov nastavite na samo za branje, da povečate varnost."

#: lib/installer.php:2404
msgid "These directories will be required to stay read writable after the install so that the Cacti remote synchronization process can update them as the Main Cacti Web Site changes"
msgstr "Ti imeniki morajo po namestitvi ostati berljivi in zapisljivi, da jih lahko postopek oddaljene sinhronizacije programa Cacti posodablja ob spremembah glavnega spletnega mesta Cacti"

#: lib/installer.php:2408
msgid "If you are installing packages, once the packages are installed, you should change the scripts directory back to read only as this presents some exposure to the web site."
msgstr "Če nameščate pakete, morate po namestitvi paketov imenik scripts nastaviti nazaj na samo za branje, ker to izpostavlja spletno mesto."

#: lib/installer.php:2410
msgid "For remote pollers, it is critical that the paths that you will be updating frequently, including the plugins, scripts, and resources paths have read/write access as the data collector will have to update these paths from the main web server content."
msgstr "Pri oddaljenih pollerjih je ključno, da imajo poti, ki jih boste pogosto posodabljali, vključno s potmi plugins, scripts in resources, dostop za branje/pisanje, saj mora zbiralnik podatkov te poti posodabljati iz vsebine glavnega spletnega strežnika."

#: lib/installer.php:2416
msgid "Required Writable at Install Time Only"
msgstr "Zapisljivo je zahtevano samo ob namestitvi"

#: lib/installer.php:2435 lib/installer.php:2468 lib/installer.php:2476
#: package_import.php:634
msgid "Not Writable"
msgstr "Ni zapisljivo"

#: lib/installer.php:2447
msgid "Required Writable after Install Complete"
msgstr "Zapisljivo je zahtevano po končani namestitvi"

#: lib/installer.php:2487
msgid "Potential permission issues"
msgstr "Možne težave z dovoljenji"

#: lib/installer.php:2496
msgid "Please make sure that your webserver has read/write access to the cacti folders that show errors below."
msgstr "Poskrbite, da ima vaš spletni strežnik dostop za branje/pisanje do map programa Cacti, ki so spodaj prikazane z napakami."

#: lib/installer.php:2499
msgid "If SELinux is enabled on your server, you can either permanently disable this, or temporarily disable it and then add the appropriate permissions using the SELinux command-line tools."
msgstr "Če je na vašem strežniku omogočen SELinux, ga lahko trajno onemogočite ali ga začasno onemogočite in nato dodate ustrezna dovoljenja z ukaznovrstičnimi orodji SELinux."

#: lib/installer.php:2508
#, php-format
msgid "The user '%s' should have MODIFY permission to enable read/write."
msgstr "Uporabnik '%s' mora imeti dovoljenje MODIFY za omogočanje branja/pisanja."

#: lib/installer.php:2517
msgid "An example of how to set folder permissions is shown here, though you may need to adjust this depending on your operating system, user accounts and desired permissions."
msgstr "Spodaj je prikazan primer nastavitve dovoljenj map, čeprav jih boste morda morali prilagoditi glede na vaš operacijski sistem, uporabniške račune in želena dovoljenja."

#: lib/installer.php:2518
msgid "EXAMPLE:"
msgstr "PRIMER:"

#: lib/installer.php:2519
msgid "Once installation has completed the CSRF path, should be set to read-only."
msgstr "Ko je namestitev končana, naj bo pot CSRF nastavljena samo za branje."

#: lib/installer.php:2521
msgid "All folders are writable"
msgstr "Vse mape so zapisljive"

#: lib/installer.php:2533
msgid "Input Validation Whitelist Protection"
msgstr "Zaščita z belim seznamom za preverjanje vnosa"

#: lib/installer.php:2534
msgid "Cacti Data Input methods that call a script can be exploited in ways that a non-administrator can perform damage to either files owned by the poller account, and in cases where someone runs the Cacti poller as root, can compromise the operating system allowing attackers to exploit your infrastructure."
msgstr "Načini vnosa podatkov programa Cacti, ki kličejo skripto, so lahko izkoriščeni tako, da lahko neskrbnik povzroči škodo datotekam v lasti računa pollerja, v primerih, ko nekdo poller Cacti izvaja kot root, pa lahko ogrozi operacijski sistem, kar napadalcem omogoča izkoriščanje vaše infrastrukture."

#: lib/installer.php:2535
msgid "Therefore, several versions ago, Cacti was enhanced to provide Whitelist capabilities on the these types of Data Input Methods.  Though this does secure Cacti more thoroughly, it does increase the amount of work required by the Cacti administrator to import and manage Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Zato je bil Cacti pred več različicami razširjen z zmožnostmi dovoljenega seznama za te vrste načinov vnosa podatkov.  Čeprav to Cacti varuje temeljiteje, povečuje obseg dela, ki ga mora skrbnik programa Cacti opraviti pri uvozu in upravljanju predlog in paketov."

#: lib/installer.php:2536
msgid "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and or arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr "Dovoljeni seznam deluje tako, da se ob prvem uvozu načina vnosa podatkov ali ob ponovnem uvozu in kakršni koli spremembi skripte in/ali argumentov način vnosa podatkov in vsi ustrezni viri podatkov takoj onemogočijo, dokler skrbnik ne potrdi, da je način vnosa podatkov veljaven."

#: lib/installer.php:2537
msgid "To make identifying Data Input Methods in this state, we have provided a validation script in Cacti's CLI directory that can be run with the following options:"
msgstr "Za lažje prepoznavanje načinov vnosa podatkov v tem stanju smo v imeniku CLI programa Cacti zagotovili skripto za preverjanje, ki jo je mogoče zagnati z naslednjimi možnostmi:"

#: lib/installer.php:2541
msgid "This script option will search for any Data Input Methods that are currently banned and provide details as to why."
msgstr "Ta možnost skripte poišče vse metode vnosa podatkov, ki so trenutno prepovedane, in poda podrobnosti o razlogu."

#: lib/installer.php:2542
msgid "This script option un-ban the Data Input Methods that are currently banned."
msgstr "Ta možnost skripte odpravi prepoved načinov vnosa podatkov, ki so trenutno prepovedani."

#: lib/installer.php:2543
msgid "This script option will re-enable any disabled Data Sources."
msgstr "Ta možnost skripte znova omogoči vse onemogočene vire podatkov."

#: lib/installer.php:2547
msgid "It is strongly suggested that you update your config.php to enable this feature by uncommenting the <b>$input_whitelist</b> variable and then running the three CLI script options above after the web based install has completed."
msgstr "Močno priporočamo, da posodobite config.php in omogočite to funkcijo z odkomentiranjem spremenljivke <b>$input_whitelist</b>, nato pa po končani spletni namestitvi zaženete zgornje tri možnosti skripte CLI."

#: lib/installer.php:2549
msgid "Check the Checkbox below to acknowledge that you have read and understand this security concern"
msgstr "Označite potrditveno polje spodaj, da potrdite, da ste prebrali in razumeli to varnostno skrb"

#: lib/installer.php:2551
msgid "I have read this statement"
msgstr "Prebral sem to izjavo"

#: lib/installer.php:2567 lib/installer.php:2573
msgid "Default Profile"
msgstr "Privzeti profil"

#: lib/installer.php:2568
msgid "Please select the default Data Source Profile to be used for polling sources.  This is the maximum amount of time between scanning devices for information so the lower the polling interval, the more work is placed on the Cacti Server host.  Also, select the intended, or configured Cron interval that you wish to use for Data Collection."
msgstr "Izberite privzeti profil vira podatkov, ki se uporabi za vire zbiranja.  To je največji čas med skeniranji naprav za informacije, zato nižji ko je interval zbiranja, več dela ima gostitelj strežnika Cacti.  Izberite tudi predvideni ali nastavljeni interval Cron, ki ga želite uporabiti za zbiranje podatkov."

#: lib/installer.php:2579
msgid "Cron Interval"
msgstr "Interval Cron"

#: lib/installer.php:2600
msgid "Default Automation Network"
msgstr "Privzeto omrežje avtomatizacije"

#: lib/installer.php:2601
msgid "Cacti can automatically scan the network once installation has completed. This will utilise the network range below to work out the range of IPs that can be scanned.  A predefined set of options are defined for scanning which include using both 'public' and 'private' communities."
msgstr "Cacti lahko po končani namestitvi samodejno skenira omrežje. Pri tem se uporabi spodnji obseg omrežja za določitev obsega naslovov IP, ki jih je mogoče skenirati.  Za skeniranje je določen vnaprej definiran nabor možnosti, ki vključuje skupnosti »public« in »private«."

#: lib/installer.php:2602
msgid "If your devices require a different set of options to be used first, you may define them below and they will be utilized before the defaults"
msgstr "Če vaše naprave zahtevajo, da se najprej uporabi drug nabor možnosti, jih lahko definirate spodaj in uporabljene bodo pred privzetimi"

#: lib/installer.php:2603
msgid "All options may be adjusted post installation"
msgstr "Vse možnosti je mogoče prilagoditi po namestitvi"

#: lib/installer.php:2607
msgid "Default Options"
msgstr "Privzete možnosti"

#: lib/installer.php:2611
msgid "Scan Mode"
msgstr "Način pregleda"

#: lib/installer.php:2616
msgid "Network Range"
msgstr "Obseg omrežja"

#: lib/installer.php:2622
msgid "Additional Defaults"
msgstr "Dodatne privzete vrednosti"

#: lib/installer.php:2643
msgid "Additional SNMP Options"
msgstr "Dodatne možnosti SNMP"

#: lib/installer.php:2656
msgid "Error Locating Profiles"
msgstr "Napaka pri iskanju profilov"

#: lib/installer.php:2657
msgid "The installation cannot continue because no profiles could be found."
msgstr "Namestitve ni mogoče nadaljevati, ker ni bilo mogoče najti nobenega profila."

#: lib/installer.php:2658
msgid "This may occur if you have a blank database and have not yet imported the cacti.sql file"
msgstr "To se lahko zgodi, če imate prazno zbirko podatkov in še niste uvozili datoteke cacti.sql"

#: lib/installer.php:2666
msgid "Template Setup"
msgstr "Nastavitev predlog"

#: lib/installer.php:2669
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to update during the Upgrade."
msgstr "Izberite predloge naprav, ki jih želite posodobiti med nadgradnjo."

#: lib/installer.php:2670
msgid "Updating Templates that you have already made modifications to is not advisable.  The Upgrade of the Templates will NOT remove modifications to Graph and Data Templates, and can lead to unexpected behavior.  However, if you have not made changes to any Graph, Data Query, or Data Template, reimporting the Package should not have any affect.  In that case, you would have to 'Sync Graphs' to from the Templates after update."
msgstr "Posodabljanje predlog, ki ste jih že spremenili, ni priporočljivo.  Nadgradnja predlog NE bo odstranila sprememb predlog grafov in podatkov ter lahko privede do nepričakovanega vedenja.  Če pa niste spremenili nobenega grafa, podatkovne poizvedbe ali predloge podatkov, ponovni uvoz paketa ne bi smel imeti učinka.  V tem primeru bi morali po posodobitvi iz predlog izvesti »Sync Graphs«."

#: lib/installer.php:2672
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to use after the Install.  If your Operating System is Windows, you need to ensure that you select the 'Windows Device' Template.  If your Operating System is Linux/UNIX, make sure you select the 'Local Linux Machine' Device Template."
msgstr "Izberite predloge naprav, ki jih želite uporabljati po namestitvi.  Če je vaš operacijski sistem Windows, morate izbrati predlogo 'Windows Device'.  Če je vaš operacijski sistem Linux/UNIX, izberite predlogo naprave 'Local Linux Machine'."

#: lib/installer.php:2678 package_import.php:532 plugins.php:621
msgid "Author"
msgstr "Avtor"

#: lib/installer.php:2678 package_import.php:535
msgid "Homepage"
msgstr "Domača stran"

#: lib/installer.php:2704
msgid "Device Templates allow you to monitor and graph a vast assortment of data within Cacti.  After you select the desired Device Templates, press 'Next' and the installation will complete.  Please be patient on this step, as the importation of the Device Templates can take a few minutes."
msgstr "Predloge naprav vam omogočajo spremljanje in izrisovanje velike raznolikosti podatkov v programu Cacti.  Ko izberete želene predloge naprav, pritisnite »Naprej« in namestitev bo dokončana.  Bodite potrpežljivi pri tem koraku, saj lahko uvoz predlog naprav traja nekaj minut."

#: lib/installer.php:2712
msgid "Server Collation"
msgstr "Primerjava znakov strežnika"

#: lib/installer.php:2719
msgid "Your server collation appears to be UTF8 compliant"
msgstr "Zdi se, da je primerjava znakov (collation) vašega strežnika skladna z UTF8"

#: lib/installer.php:2722
msgid "Your server collation does NOT appear to be fully UTF8 compliant. "
msgstr "Zdi se, da primerjava znakov (collation) vašega strežnika NI popolnoma skladna z UTF8. "

#: lib/installer.php:2723
msgid "Under the [mysqld] section, locate the entries named 'character-set-server' and 'collation-server' and set them as follows:"
msgstr "V razdelku [mysqld] poiščite vnosa 'character-set-server' in 'collation-server' ter ju nastavite takole:"

#: lib/installer.php:2730
msgid "Database Collation"
msgstr "Primerjava znakov zbirke podatkov"

#: lib/installer.php:2735
msgid "Your database default collation appears to be UTF8 compliant"
msgstr "Zdi se, da je privzeta primerjava znakov (collation) vaše zbirke podatkov skladna z UTF8"

#: lib/installer.php:2738
msgid "Your database default collation does NOT appear to be full UTF8 compliant. "
msgstr "Privzeta kolacija vaše zbirke podatkov ni videti popolnoma skladna z UTF8. "

#: lib/installer.php:2739
msgid "Any tables created by plugins may have issues linked against Cacti Core tables if the collation is not matched.   Please ensure your database is changed to 'utf8mb4_unicode_ci' by running the following: "
msgstr "Vse tabele, ki jih ustvarijo vtičniki, imajo lahko težave pri povezavi s tabelami jedra Cacti, če se kolacija ne ujema.   Poskrbite, da bo vaša zbirka podatkov spremenjena v »utf8mb4_unicode_ci« z naslednjim ukazom: "

#: lib/installer.php:2746
msgid "Table Setup"
msgstr "Nastavitev tabel"

#: lib/installer.php:2757
#, php-format
msgid "You have more tables than your PHP configuration will allow us to display/convert.  Please modify the max_input_vars setting in php.ini to a value above %s"
msgstr "Imate več tabel, kot jih vaša konfiguracija PHP dovoljuje prikazati/pretvoriti.  Spremenite nastavitev max_input_vars v php.ini na vrednost nad %s"

